Thu Oct 27 21:51:47 1994  John Salmon  <johns@magician>

	* mpmy_io.[ch]:  New function:  MPMY_Mkdir.  Used by MsgdirInit.

	* mpmy_io.h: No longer support MPMY_Fiomode.  It wasn't even in
