Fri Sep 30 09:54:27 1994  Mike Warren  (msw@sampson)

	* libsw/error.c (Error): Add physical node number to error output
	for intel machines.  This might help isolate bad nodes.

	* libmpmy/mpmy_generic.c: Modify the delay mechanism for out-of-buffer
	response.  (NOT INCORPORATED.  OBSOLETED BY NEWER CODE - johns)

	* libsw/timeout.c: Provide a mechanism to terminate failed jobs.
	Call TimeOutInit(t) to start an alarm that goes off and kills
	the node after t seconds, unless TimeOutReset(t) is called in
	the interim.  This will hopefully prevent a failed job from
	sitting on the paragon under NQS for 5 hours doing nothing.

